OL,3,GNEWSAPowerboat racer crashed at 70mph,
OL,4,Ainquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA powerboat racer was travelling at
OL,7,Fspeeds of about 70mph (113km/h) when he
OL,8,Fcrashed into a houseboat and suffered
OL,9,Ffatal head injuries, an inquest heard.
OL,11,FBrett Duncan, 51, of Martlesham Heath,
OL,12,FSuffolk, had been on a practice run
OL,13,Fduring an international competition on
OL,14,FOulton Broad on 24 July last year.
OL,16,FHe was driving his hydroplane when he
OL,17,Fhit Jaki Beech's boat, which withstood
OL,18,Fthe impact due to its steel frame. He
OL,19,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
