OL,3,GNEWSAPowerboat racer crashed at 70mph,
OL,4,Ainquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Coroner's Court in Ipswich was
OL,7,Ftold that only six seconds had elapsed
OL,8,Fbetween Duncan leaving the line of the
OL,9,Fcourse and hitting the houseboat.
